  (a) "unit5" is mounted;
  (b) both "unit5" is routed and "unit5" is rated, then "unit3" is classified as "ready_packing_completed".

If all of the following hold:
  (a) "unit5" is bundled;
  (b) both "unit5" is retained and "unit5" is packed, then "unit3" is classified as "ready_staffing_arranged".

All of the following hold:
  (a) if "unit5" is stacked, then "unit1" is classified as "stable_temperature_constant";
  (b) all of the following hold:
    (i) if "unit5" is checked, then "unit1" is classified as "stable_shape_retained";
    (ii) if "unit5" is scanned, then "unit5" is classified as "stable_shape_retained".

